<title>AUSTRALIA: TENNIS-WOMEN'S INTERNATIONAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-WOMEN'S INTERNATIONAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>HOBART, Australia 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the</p>
<p>Tasmanian Women's International tennis tournamenton Monday</p>
<p>(prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>First round</p>
<p>Els Callens (Belgium) beat Miho Saeki (Japan) 7-6 7-5</p>
<p>Rita Grande (Italy) beat Elena Makarova (Russia) 7-6 6-1</p>
<p>Lenka Cenkova (Czech Republic) beat Barbara Rittner (Germany)</p>
<p>7-5 6-3</p>
<p>7-Florencia Labat (Argentina) beat Patty Schnyder (Switzerland)</p>
<p>7-6 7-5</p>
<p>Anne-Gaelle Sidot (France) bt Paola Suarez (Argentina) 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>Wang Shi-Ting (Taiwan) bt Anne Kremer (Luxembourg) 6-3 1-6 6-2</p>
<p>Dominique van Roost (Belgium) beat 3-Linda Wild (U.S.) 6-1 6-2</p>
</text>
